    <body>
      <div xml:id="gom-is25">
        <head xml:id="gom-is25-Hd1e98">Caput 25</head>
        <div xml:id="gom-is25-Dd1e100">
          <head xml:id="gom-is25-Hd1e102">Versus 1</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is25-d1e104">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is25-Qd1e106" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is25_1@17-17">Amen.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is25-Rd1e109"><name xml:id="gom-is25-Nd1e110" ref="#Jerome">HIER.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is25-Qd1e113">Hebraeum, quo saepe Dominus utitur in Evangelio: <quote xml:id="gom-is25-Qd1e115">Amen amen,</quote> id est vere vere <quote xml:id="gom-is25-Qd1e117">dico vobis.</quote></quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is25-Dd1e121">
          <head xml:id="gom-is25-Hd1e123">Versus 2</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is25-d1e125">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is25-Qd1e127" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is25_2@3-3">Civitas.</quote>
            Eversa a Nabuchodonosor, restituta est a Neemia, et a Jesu summo sacerdote. Eversa a Romanis, restituta est ab Aelio Adriano; sed non in eodem loco, nec in statum pristinum.
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is25-d1e131">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is25-Qd1e133" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is25_2@16-18">Et in sempiternum.</quote>
            <ref xml:id="gom-is25-Rd1e136"><name xml:id="gom-is25-Nd1e137" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is25-Qd1e140">Ut mille annorum regnum <pb ed="#P" n="1269B"/> et aureae Jerusalem et gemmatae fabula quiescat.</quote>
          </p>
        </div>
        <div xml:id="gom-is25-Dd1e147">
          <head xml:id="gom-is25-Hd1e149">Versus 10</head>
          <p xml:id="gom-is25-d1e151">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is25-Qd1e153" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is25_10@8-10">Et triturabitur Moab,</quote>
            etc.
            <ref xml:id="gom-is25-Rd1e156"><name xml:id="gom-is25-Nd1e157" ref="#Jerome">ID.</name></ref>
            <quote xml:id="gom-is25-Qd1e160"><seg type="qs">Licet generaliter de consummatione mundi loqueretur</seg>, etc., usque ad <seg type="qs">per Moab igitur recte intelligimus diabolum filiis Dei semper adversarium.</seg></quote>
          </p>
          <p xml:id="gom-is25-d1e168">
            <quote xml:id="gom-is25-Qd1e170" type="lemma" source="http://scta.info/resource/is25_10@15-17">Paleae in plaustro.</quote>
            Ferratis plaustris teruntur paleae, ut eas facilius animalia et pascant et ruminent.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </body>
